sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant Edge as Edge and load balancing
    participant Svc as Service tier
    participant Ca as Cache
    participant Str as Storage
    participant Obs as Observability
    U->>Edge: request
    Edge->>Edge: terminate TLS, route to the closest healthy region
    Edge->>Svc: forward with a deadline
    Svc->>Ca: read path first
    alt hit
        Ca-->>Svc: value
    else miss
        Svc->>Str: read from the partition that owns this key
        Str-->>Svc: row
        Svc->>Ca: populate
    end
    Svc-->>U: response
    Svc->>Obs: latency, errors, saturation per dependency
    Note over Obs: the SLO is measured where the user is, not where the server is
